(548, 9, 66, 'SCIENTIFIC OR TECHNICAL AWARD (Class III)', true, NULL, 'Sound', NULL, 'To RCA MANUFACTURING CO., INC., for their development of a method of recording and printing sound records utilizing a restricted spectrum (known as ultra-violet light recording).'),
