(1299, 14, 45, 'SPECIAL EFFECTS', false, 'Photographic Effects by Byron Haskin; Sound Effects by Nathan Levinson', NULL, 'NOTE: Not originally one of the nominees announced on February 9, 1942. Dive Bomber, another Warner Bros. production, was on the list, but sometime between the 10th and 19th of February, the Dive Bomber nomination was replaced by The Sea Wolf, with the same people credited for the achievement. There is no explanation in the files as to why the replacement was made.', NULL),
