(1387, 15, 3, 'DOCUMENTARY', true, 'United States Navy', NULL, 'NOTE: \"A special award to Battle of Midway for the historical value of its achievement in offering a camera record of one of the decisive battles of the world - a record unique both for the courage of those who made it under fire, and for its magnificent portrayal of the gallantry of our armed forces in battle.\"', NULL),
