(1518, 15, 66, 'SCIENTIFIC OR TECHNICAL AWARD (Class III)', true, NULL, 'Special Photographic', NULL, 'To ROBERT HENDERSON and the PARAMOUNT STUDIO ENGINEERING and TRANSPARENCY DEPARTMENTS for the design and construction of adjustable light bridges and screen frames for transparency process photography.'),
