(2610, 23, 18, 'WRITING (Screenplay)', false, 'Albert Maltz', NULL, 'NOTE: Based upon the research made by, and the board motion of, the Writers Guild of America West, the Academy, on July 3, 1991, decided to restore Albert Maltz to the screenplay credit on the 1950 film Broken Arrow. Michael Blankfort had fronted for him on the screenplay and consequently was named in the screenplay nomination. Mr. Blankfort''s name was removed from the nomination.', NULL),
