(2743, 24, 65, 'SCIENTIFIC OR TECHNICAL AWARD (Class II)', true, NULL, 'Special Photographic', NULL, 'To OLIN L. DUPY of Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Studio for the design, construction and application of a motion picture reproducing system.'),
